    sceneImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: a09e44be771edb04a8243da2fe32068f, type: 3}
    sceneButton: {fileID: 0}
    addSceneToList: 1
    fontSize: 20
    titleFontSize: 0
  - Name: Advanced Mission System
    sceneDescription: A demo showing more advanced elements of the save system, with
      different missions triggered by dialog, board missions, etc...
    sceneNumber: 34
    sceneImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 379cdf99d8284e944badfe0e73a24eab, type: 3}
    sceneButton: {fileID: 0}
    addSceneToList: 1
    fontSize: 20
    titleFontSize: 0
  - Name: Mission System
    sceneDescription: A short demo to show the mission/objective system, with just
      a couple of missions in the level.
    sceneNumber: 35
    sceneImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: da933a055970de841879e9bdf866ac23, type: 3}
    sceneButton: {fileID: 0}
    addSceneToList: 1
    fontSize: 20
    titleFontSize: 0
  - Name: Objectives System
    sceneDescription: A short demo focused on showing icons in the screen, for things
      like reach an specific place for a mission, use the player waypoint system
      to render a path for the player, add icons to the compass, a little of the
      map, system, etc...
    sceneNumber: 36
    sceneImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 85b6b2c7d5baef245b5ca2ea8bf152dd, type: 3}
    sceneButton: {fileID: 0}
    addSceneToList: 1
    fontSize: 16
    titleFontSize: 0
  - Name: Oxygen-Free Floating Mode-Gravity System
    sceneDescription: A more advanced demo with different systems combined, like
