    sceneNumber: 37
    sceneImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 6a68ed84b6005ed4fb61a26cf2ded7d3, type: 3}
    sceneButton: {fileID: 0}
    addSceneToList: 1
    fontSize: 16
    titleFontSize: 0
  - Name: AI Pooling and Fire Weapons
    sceneDescription: A simple demo scene which allows to spawn different type of
      AI, including zombies with destroyable parts and test the fire weapons on them.
    sceneNumber: 38
    sceneImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 4dccd440d50593f488494e3989012c2b, type: 3}
    sceneButton: {fileID: 0}
    addSceneToList: 1
    fontSize: 16
    titleFontSize: 0
  - Name: Possession System With Smartphone
    sceneDescription: A short demo to show the possession system, to control many
      different objects with the smartphone tool, such as explosive barrels, crates,
      security cameras, AI turrets, regular rigidbodies, vehicles and enemy AI, allowing
      to move undetected by their faction.
    sceneNumber: 39
    sceneImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 87b4a32f1f3bcb048aa3189e2b9b8ba7, type: 3}
    sceneButton: {fileID: 0}
    addSceneToList: 1
    fontSize: 15
    titleFontSize: 0
  - Name: Possession System
    sceneDescription: A short demo to show the possession system, to control many
      different objects, such as explosive barrels, crates, security cameras, AI
      turrets, regular rigidbodies, vehicles and enemy AI, allowing to move undetected
      by their faction.
    sceneNumber: 40
    sceneImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: d76830128d31dc846bad748d42cf7905, type: 3}
    sceneButton: {fileID: 0}
    addSceneToList: 1
    fontSize: 16
    titleFontSize: 0
  - Name: Powers Demo First Person
    sceneDescription: A short demo to show the weapon system, with powers/abilities
