  - Name: Vehicles
    sceneDescription: A level to try vehicles, having vending machines to get more
      vehicles if they are destroyed for example, or just to have a lot of them.
      The scene is also made to try the gravity system on vehicles and the waypoint
      platforms as well. All vehicles are placed here with marks on screen to know
